    "statement": "Design a sequential circuit that computes x + y in binary: two input streams x and y arrive one bit per clock tick (least-significant bit first, in parallel), and the circuit emits the binary numeral for their sum, one bit per tick. (Hint: add the two incoming bits plus a carry remembered in a MEM block from the previous tick.)",
